        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF145 supports the <code class=\"notranslate\">Integrity-Policy</code> for scripts in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1984973\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1984973</a> (note, not for styles, and implementation is partial because reporting doesn't work except via console).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This updates the features from preview that were previously updated in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3323947341\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27587\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27587/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27587\">#27587</a>. Note this did not get picked up in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3517304046\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28199\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28199/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28199\">#28199</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3510308431\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41511\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41511/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41511\">mdn/content#41511</a></p>",
