        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/965338?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #23922.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2423016064\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/23922\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/23922/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/23922\">#23922</a></p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add keyboard-inset-* variables that are defined in Virtual Keyboard API (<a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/virtual-keyboard/#keyboard-inset-variables\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/virtual-keyboard/#keyboard-inset-variables</a>).</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 94. Google has published about this as <a href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/docs/web-platform/virtual-keyboard\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.chrome.com/docs/web-platform/virtual-keyboard</a>.</p>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
